<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia rises to 1.768 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia rises to 1.768 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia rose to 1.768 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange from 1.769 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				    October 9	    October 8</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar	  1.768		  1.769</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $5.96 million	    $11.72 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
